<title>USA: COR says FDA panel reviews drug.</title>
<headline>COR says FDA panel reviews drug.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>COR Therapeutics Inc said Friday a U.S. Food and Drug Administration panel is reviewing its integrilin drug.</p>
<p>A company spokeswoman told Reuters she expected the panel to issue a statement later today on the drug review.  She said integrilin is an acute care hospital drug.</p>
</text>
